  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA - Country Based Pooled Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA have a regional pooled fund, which will allow for improved prioritization of emergency response. This will have a focus on preparedness (prepositioning), as well as support for underfunded sectors and activities, especially for hard-to-reach areas.  The UK will support this effort as a means for engendering improved leadership and coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
